WEBVTT

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:18.760
Sheesh!

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:27.170
Lua, I told you not to drive so fast!

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:31.690
There's no point saying that to 
the future Riding Duel champion.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:33.030
See you, Luca!

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:40.540
Luca!

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.380
Was that your brother, Luca?

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:43.520
He's cool!

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:46.720
He's nothing compared 
to Yusei and the others.

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:51.430
Crow, you're really leaving the team?

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:52.590
Why?

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:55.130
We've become world champions!

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:58.330
I've done everything I can as a team.

00:00:58.610 --> 00:01:00.940
I have nothing left to teach you.

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:06.340
I want to test my own 
strength, just like Jack.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:08.040
Crow...

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:11.490
And the person who's 
 replacing me on this team

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.350
will definitely do more
than I've done.

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:16.430
Jack Atlas!

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:22.060
King, Crow Hogan has declared that he'll 
participate in next season's single league.

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:24.620
Crow says that he's going to become champ.

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:25.660
Do you care to comment?

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:32.530
Tell Crow that even if he gangs 
up, he can never defeat me!

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:36.760
I will never lose until 
I beat a certain person.

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:47.420
Tell Crow that even if he gangs 
up, he can never defeat me!

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:50.450
Sheesh, Jack never changes.

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:53.150
Dr. Aki! I can't handle it anymore!

00:01:53.150 --> 00:01:55.400
I can't watch anymore!

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:56.790
You can't give up.

00:01:58.440 --> 00:02:02.230
We have to smile and cheer them on.

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:06.930
Dr. Aki, why are you so tough?

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:11.440
Never give up and always keep smiling.

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:13.410
Someone taught me that.

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:17.500
To believe in your own potential 
and keep challenging.

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:20.050
That's why I can try hard.

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:25.220
So that someday, I can proudly 
meet the person who taught me that.

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:31.990
Red Nova Dragon gains 500 attack points 
for every Tuner Monster in my graveyard!

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:35.430
There are five Tuner 
Monsters in my graveyard!

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:41.190
Therefore, Red Nova Dragon 
gains 2500 attack points!

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:53.250
I set one card and end my turn!

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:54.780
My turn!

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:58.580
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:02:58.850 --> 00:03:02.540
I remove 7 Speed Counters to draw one card!

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:06.220
I summon the Tuner Monster Mach Synchron!

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:13.700
Level 1 Mach Synchron 
tunes Level 1 Sonic Chick!

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:18.490
The wishes come together to 
invite a new world of speed!

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:20.240
Become the path that lights the way!

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:21.440
Synchro Summon!

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:22.990
The power of hope!

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:24.540
Formula Synchron!

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:28.160
When Mach Synchron is 
used as Synchro Material,

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:30.950
non-Mach Synchron Synchro 
Material returns to the hand.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:34.920
When Formula Synchron is 
successfully Synchro Summoned,

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.390
I draw one card from my deck!

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.990
Synchro Tuner? He's 
planning to bring that out!

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:44.900
Clear Mind!

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:53.540
Level 2 Synchro Tuner Formula Synchron tunes 
Level 8 Synchro Monster Stardust Dragon!

00:03:57.370 --> 00:04:01.130
Dreams crystallize to open 
a new door of evolution!

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:02.780
Become the path that lights the way!

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:07.280
Accel Synchro!

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:09.720
He vanished!

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:11.090
Arise!

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:15.000
Shooting Star Dragon!

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.880
Light Points to the Future

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.380
Shooting Star Dragon, you appeared!

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.360
You're targeting Crimson Blader!

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:43.180
But due to Red Nova Dragon's effect,

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:47.190
it can remove itself from play this 
turn to negate your attack!

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:49.070
But you can only do that once!

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:52.930
Shooting Star Dragon checks  
the top five cards in my deck,

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:55.300
and it can attack for every 
Tuner Monster among them!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:05.320
I drew three Tuners!

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:08.980
Therefore, Shooting Star 
can attack three times!

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:11.180
Stardust Mirage!

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:14.880
This route will now be 
prioritized for dueling.

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:18.040
Who's dueling so early in the morning?

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.310
It's fine.

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:21.190
Duels are priority in this city!

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:25.960
It's Yusei and Jack!

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:27.460
Do your best, Yusei!

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:31.070
Shooting Star Dragon attacks Crimson Blader!

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:42.480
Attack me with your 
two remaining attacks, Yusei!

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:45.530
That is, if you really think  
you can blast away my soul!

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:50.380
Red Nova has 6000 attack points.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:53.800
Shooting Star has 3300 attack points.

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:55.360
Jack is being unrealistic.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:59.330
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:10.490
My turn!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:16.480
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Red Cocoon!

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:19.920
This card equips on to Red Nova.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:24.170
When Red Nova battles, your 
monster's effects are negated!

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:27.720
That means Shooting Star 
can't escape from the field!

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:30.290
If this attack succeeds, Jack wins!

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:32.260
What are you going to do, Yusei?

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:36.330
Red Nova Dragon attacks 
Shooting Star Dragon!

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:38.460
Burning Soul!

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:42.670
I activate the trap High and Low!

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:47.710
I send one card in my deck to the 
graveyard, and if it's a monster,

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:52.250
my monster that's attacked 
gains that card's attack points!

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:54.960
This effect can be used up to three times,

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:59.180
but if my monster's attack points become 
greater than your monster's attack points,

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:00.900
my monster is destroyed!

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:02.840
I see.

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:05.720
You're using that effect
 to take less damage.

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:06.870
Jack!

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:09.050
This is a move to test my future!

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:12.940
This draw will most likely 
point to my future!

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:13.980
I draw!

00:07:15.270 --> 00:07:17.430
Sonic Warrior has 1000 attack points!

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:22.360
I draw a second card!

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:25.790
Speed Warrior has 900 attack points!

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:32.560
The difference in their 
attack points is now 800!

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:34.880
Yusei will barely survive
with 100 life points!

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:39.890
Shooting Star will now be destroyed, 
and your field will be empty!

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:42.990
I'll use High and Low's 
effect for a third time!

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:47.360
If you draw a monster with more than 
800 attack points, it'll self-destruct!

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:49.770
I know that.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:52.890
You're not someone I can 
beat without taking a risk.

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:56.940
I will bet my potential on this draw!

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:59.360
Deck, answer me!

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:09.740
Yusei!

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:11.690
There isn't any road ahead of you!

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:12.590
Give up!

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:16.860
Yusei!

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:22.550
The third card!

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:29.440
Quillbolt Hedgehog has 800 attack points!

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.810
Therefore, Shooting Star 
has 6000 attack points!

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:34.530
Incredible!

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:37.110
Yusei brought his future to himself.

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:38.090
No way!

00:08:38.090 --> 00:08:41.980
You made Shooting Star have the 
same attack points as Red Nova!

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:58.800
But since Red Cocoon that's equipped 
on Red Nova was destroyed,

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:03.270
I can Special Summon Red Dragon 
Archfiend during the End Phase!

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.970
I activate the trap Crush Star!

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.880
When a Synchro Monster on 
the field is destroyed,

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:13.680
I can Special Summon a monster with 
1000 or fewer attack points

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:15.680
from my hand and graveyard 
in defense position!

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:18.640
Come, Sonic Chick and Sonic Warrior!

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:20.990
I end my turn!

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:24.600
Resurrect, Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:34.000
Yusei, those weaklings can't stand up
 to my Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:35.830
Are you sure about that?

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:36.800
What?

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:41.510
Jack, I can see my answer!

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:42.910
My turn!

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.980
I summon Junk Synchron!

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:54.520
When Junk Synchron is summoned,

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:58.520
I can Special Summon a Level 2-or-below 
monster in defense position!

00:09:58.520 --> 00:10:00.740
Resurrect, Speed Warrior!

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:04.750
When there's a 
Tuner Monster on the field,

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:07.500
I can Special Summon Quillbolt 
Hedgehog from my graveyard!

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:10.800
Those monsters are...

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.670
They're cards that Yusei
has always been using.

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:18.180
No matter how low their attack points, 
no matter how low their Levels...

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:21.780
Yusei loves those monsters 
and always uses them.

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:25.110
They're his friends that have 
always helped him duel!

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:30.150
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes 
Lvel 2 Sonic Warrior!

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:34.960
The stars come together 
to call forth a new power!

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:36.520
Become the path that lights the way!

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:38.830
Synchro Summon!

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.510
Come forth, Junk Warrior!

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:49.870
You play Junk Warrior now?

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:52.600
When Sonic Warrior is 
used as Synchro Material,

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:56.780
Level 2-or-below monsters on the 
field gain 400 attack points!

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:01.920
When Junk Warrior 
is Synchro Summoned,

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:06.990
it gains attack points equal to the total attack 
points of all Level 2-or-below monsters.

00:11:07.650 --> 00:11:09.320
Power of Fellows!

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:12.430
5500 attack points?

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:16.400
Yusei's monster powered up 
due to the power of their bond.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:20.270
This is the potential that 
Yusei mentioned.

00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:23.950
If we also have a bond, we 
can always remain strong!

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.370
I've made my decision!

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:28.210
I've also decided.

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:29.080
Me too!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:30.050
Me too!

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:31.780
Jack!

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:36.880
Our duel has taught 
me what lives in my soul!

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:40.320
You finally found your path.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:43.420
I will remain in this city!

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:47.320
Yusei...

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:50.160
Here I go, Jack!

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:02.440
Junk Warrior attacks Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:10.950
Scrap Fist!

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:49.790
Well done, Yusei.

00:12:53.680 --> 00:12:55.990
Nothing in the world is useless.

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:59.880
Your bond created a mighty attack 
that defeated the powerful.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:02.120
That resonated in my soul, Yusei!

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:05.070
I now have a reason
 to come back here.

00:13:05.070 --> 00:13:06.970
Come back anytime.

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:08.770
I'll be waiting.

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.440
I won't lose next time!

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:15.650
Let's use all our strength again!

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:21.580
Yusei!

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:23.320
Everyone!

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:29.210
I've decided to go the pro league, Yusei!

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:31.610
I'll make sure to study!

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:32.990
Me too!

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:35.130
When I get there, I'll 
write a letter every week!

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:38.570
I'll let them pamper me 
to make up for lost time!

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:41.310
You've each found your path.

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:42.270
Yeah.

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:43.640
Yeah.

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:44.840
Yeah!

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:50.710
No matter how far apart we 
are, our bond is forever!

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:51.990
Yeah!

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:05.210
We went through a lot of events.

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:06.040
Yeah.

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:08.680
I'll never forget what happened in this city.

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:10.130
Lua, you've changed.

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:11.600
Really?

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:16.070
You used to be a crybaby, 
 but I can now rely on you.

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:17.660
Really?

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.480
Yes. You've become a man.

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:23.080
Because from now on, I have  
to protect you on my own.

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:25.250
I'm counting on you, brother!

00:14:28.640 --> 00:14:29.790
I see.

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:33.630
If that's the path you've chosen, 
I will support you.

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:34.890
Thank you.

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:37.530
But what do I tell the kids?

00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:40.590
They will be sad, 
but it can't be helped.

00:14:40.590 --> 00:14:42.630
Everyone, come over here!

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:45.840
Hey, Crow! How have you been?

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:47.680
I heard you're going to the pro league!

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:49.970
Are your skills good enough?

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:52.170
You knew?

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:53.550
Well yeah!

00:14:53.550 --> 00:14:55.880
We're no longer kids!

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:58.080
We won't be sad even if 
you're not around.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:14:59.410
Just go.

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:03.920
We'll grow up!

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:06.750
Yeah, we'll grow up!

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:08.460
No, you guys!

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:12.460
We're supposed to see Crow off 
without making him worry!

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:18.830
Thank you, everyone.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:21.300
Crow!

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:23.270
Promise to come back!

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:25.970
Promise!

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:27.170
Yeah.

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:31.830
I'll come back strong so that
 I can always be your dream!

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:41.050
You're really going.

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:41.890
Yes.

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.500
You don't need to worry.

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:47.360
I'm no longer a child.

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:51.680
Knowing you, I'm worried that you'll 
collapse from working too hard.

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:53.830
Did you say goodbye to him?

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.410
To Yusei.

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:59.080
You are how you are
 thanks to him.

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:01.020
You should talk to him.

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:07.180
Go see him so that 
you'll never forget his smile.

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:11.400
That will cheer you up  
even if you're far away.

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:13.720
I understand.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:19.860
Jack!

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:22.030
Master Atlas.

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:23.480
What do you want?

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:27.080
As a representative of the former Public 
Maintenance Department, I brought a gift.

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:28.200
A gift?

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:31.360
What's with that amount?

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:34.090
You have a lot of fans.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:37.130
This is my new headquarters.

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:39.110
Bring it to its public 
relations department!

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:40.810
What's that?

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:43.580
Carly!  What are you doing?

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:45.080
You found me?

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:47.920
This way, I can go with Jack.

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:49.290
No you can't!

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:50.750
Get off, Carly!

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:52.860
My goal is to become 
top of the world!

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.490
Women are a distraction!

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:56.460
Jack...

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:01.670
You're really leaving, Master Atlas?

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:06.300
When I return, I'll be ruler 
of the world! Farewell!

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:12.610
Are you fine with letting 
him leave, Mikage?

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:16.440
In truth, I want to tell him that 
I won't let him leave.

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:17.580
Me too!

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:20.040
I want to do in-depth reports on him!

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:24.400
Master Atlas isn't someone we can hold back.

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:26.220
I knew that from the start.

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:30.690
No one can stop Jack's wild soul!

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.660
Mikage... Carly...

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:37.440
That's why I decided to wait forever.

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:40.320
I'll also wait for Jack to return!

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:41.140
Me too!

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:42.160
Wait a second!

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.900
Why are you waiting?

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:46.170
If you wait, you'll be 
a granny! So give up!

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:47.080
What did you say?

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.610
I have to wait because
I'm not that noticeable!

00:17:59.040 --> 00:17:59.860
Aki?

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:02.660
Don't turn on the lights.

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:08.230
While I was waiting here, I 
began to remember many things.

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.620
I can't let you see how I look.

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:14.140
Yusei, you're the only one left.

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:16.060
Yeah. What's up?

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:20.810
I wanted to make sure 
I said goodbye to you, Yusei.

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:22.780
I see.

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:24.350
Yusei...

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:26.400
How I feel about you is...

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:32.990
I'm happy that I met you.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:35.960
Me too, Aki.

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:41.830
When I first met you, 
I thought you were scary.

00:18:44.210 --> 00:18:45.740
Same goes for me.

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:48.460
It's really scary when
 you glare at me.

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:52.540
I was scared what would happen if 
we ever lost a team battle.

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:55.140
What? You thought that?

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:58.200
Aki, don't forget to smile.

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:01.610
Your smile is the greatest in the world.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:06.320
You're the one who made me smile, Yusei.

00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:31.980
Well, I'm going.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:33.510
Yeah. Go.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:52.120
I found someone suspicious.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.670
I will begin my interrogation.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:55.710
Hey!

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:56.640
Ushio.

00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:58.840
What are you doing so late?

00:20:00.180 --> 00:20:02.270
I don't want to sleep tonight.

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:07.380
I want to feel the air while they're 
still here and engrave it in my heart.

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:09.980
How cheesy.

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:14.900
Everyone is leaving tomorrow.

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:16.820
Are you really okay with that?

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:21.490
In truth, I want to tell everyone 
to stay here together forever.

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:25.700
But I can't do that because 
everyone chose their own path.

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:28.900
Won't this hurt your bond?

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:30.970
A bond is a bond.

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:32.330
It will never break.

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:37.960
But our future can't be fulfilled 
by solely relying on our bond.

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:42.260
Everyone has to live by taking 
responsibility for their own lives.

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:43.750
And now's the time.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:47.850
We're each heading towards our next stage.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:52.690
I don't know when, but 
you've all grown up.

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:57.270
During my battle against Jack,
I realized that this city is me.

00:20:57.270 --> 00:21:01.200
My soul has always been 
together with this city.

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:01.790
That's why...

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:02.760
Hey!

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:07.000
When they come back
to our hometown,

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:11.740
they'll realize the city that 
Team 5D's saved is a wonderful place.

00:21:12.340 --> 00:21:16.250
It's my mission to make Neo Domino 
City a place that we're proud of.

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:36.280
Here we go, everyone!

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:37.930
This is our last run!

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:53.310
I promise to come back as the true King!

00:21:54.560 --> 00:21:57.250
Kids, watch what I do!

00:21:58.720 --> 00:22:00.720
Thank you, Neo Domino City!

00:22:00.720 --> 00:22:02.560
Our hometown!

00:22:04.470 --> 00:22:05.950
I won't say goodbye.

00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:07.390
Until we meet again!

00:22:09.910 --> 00:22:10.830
Crimson Dragon?

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:18.480
Look! The marks!

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:19.610
They're leaving!

00:22:30.680 --> 00:22:34.390
Crimson Dragon, you finished your mission.

00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:06.220
Ahead is the future that we create.

00:23:06.220 --> 00:23:10.780
Everyone, let's keep running on 
the Riding Duel we call life!

00:23:11.730 --> 00:23:13.140
Riding Duel!

00:23:13.730 --> 00:23:14.940
Acceleration!
